# Repo-root build contexts: the indexer image (Containerfile.indexer, also
# dev-env/build/indexer.Dockerfile) and the web image (Containerfile.web,
# which builds the wasm bundle from the Rust workspace). Everything else —
# notably the 19G Rust target/ — must stay out of the build context. Ignore
# all, then re-include what the builds copy.
*
!apps/indexer
!lexicons
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates
!apps/cli
!apps/web
!package.json
!bun.lock
!packages
!tests
tests/*
!tests/package.json

# Drop build artifacts even within the re-included paths; the image runs a
# fresh mix deps.get / compile.
apps/indexer/_build
apps/indexer/deps
apps/indexer/.elixir_ls
**/target
**/node_modules
apps/web/dist
packages/*/dist
packages/opake-sdk/wasm
**/.DS_Store
